f4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 He sang the gavottes, and then, looking like a man deeply moved, swimming in joy, his eyes damp, he added, rubbing his hands together, \uc1 \u8220 ?You\uc1 \u8217 ?d have a fine house\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?he measured its extent with his arms\uc1 \u8212 ?\uc1 \u8220 ?a fine bed\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?he stretched himself out on it nonchalantly\uc1 \u8212 ?\uc1 \u8220 ?good wines\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?which he tasted by smacking his tongue against his palate\uc1 \u8212 ?\uc1 \u8220 ?a fine horse and carriage\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?he raised his foot as if to climb in\uc1 \u8212 ?\uc1 \u8220 ?beautiful women\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?he felt their breasts and gazed at them amorously\uc1 \u8212 ?\uc1 \u8220 ?A hundred hangers-on would come to sing my praises every day\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u8212 ?he imagined he saw them all around him\uc1 \u8212 ?Palissot, Poincinet, the two Fr\uc1 \u233 ?rons, father and son, La Porte\uc1 \u8212 ?he listened to them, he puffed himself up, agreed with what they said, smiled at them, ignored them, scorned them, sent them off, and called them back.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \fi-480 \cufi-200 \li480 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin480 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \