fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \line }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Do you know that feeling?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \fi-480 \cufi-200 \li480 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin480 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \fi-480 \cufi-200 \li480 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin480 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 HIM}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \line }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Of course, I know it! How many times have I said to myself, \uc1 \u8220 ?Rameau, how come there are ten thousand fine tables in Paris, each with fifteen or twenty places, and with all those places there\uc1 \u8217 ?s not one for you! There are purses full of gold spilling over left and right, and no coin falls on you! A thousand fine half wits without talent or merit, a thousand tiny creatures without charm, a thousand insipid schemers are well dressed, and you\uc1 \u8217 ?d walk around completely naked? In this business how could you be so stupid? Couldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t you lie, swear, forswear, promise, and then perform or fail to perform, like everyone else? Couldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t you crawl on hands and knees like the others? Couldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t you promote a lady\uc1 \u8217 ?s affair and carry a love letter from a gentleman, like anyone else? Couldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t you encourage this young man to speak to this young lady and persuade her to listen to him, like other men? Couldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t you tell the daughter of one of our bourgeois that she is badly dressed, that some fine earrings, a little rouge, lace, and a Polish-style dress would make her look ravishing, that those little feet of hers were not made to walk in the street, that there\uc1 \u8217 ?s a fine gentleman, young and rich, who has a coat trimmed in gold, a superb carriage, and six huge footmen, who saw her as she was passing by and finds her }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 charming,}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  and who, since that day, has lost his desire for food and drink, doesn\uc1 \u8217 ?t sleep }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 anymore}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 , and will die for her. \uc1 \u8216 ?But what about my father?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Yes, yes, your father! He will be a little angry at first.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?And what about Mummy? She\uc1 \u8217 ?s told me so often to be a respectable girl. She tells me there\uc1 \u8217 ?s nothing in the world but honour.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?An ancient saying which doesn\uc1 \u8217 ?t mean a thing.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?And my father confessor?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?You won\uc1 \u8217 ?t see him anymore. Or if you continue the fanciful notion of going to him to tell the story of your amusements, it will cost you some pounds of sugar and coffee.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?But he\uc1 \u8217 ?s a strict man who has already refused me absolution for singing }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Viens dans ma cellule}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 .\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?That\uc1 \u8217 ?s because you didn\uc1 \u8217 ?t have anything to give him, but when you appear before him in lace . . .\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Then I\uc1 \u8217 ?ll have lace dresses?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?There\uc1 \u8217 ?s no doubt about it, all sorts of them, and fine diamond earrings.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?So I\uc1 \u8217 ?ll have beautiful diamond earrings?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Yes.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Just like the ones belonging to that marquise who comes sometimes to buy gloves in our shop?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?That\uc1 \u8217 ?s right. In a fine carriage with dappled gray horses, two large footmen, a small Negro, and a man running in front; you\uc1 \u8217 ?ll have rouge, beauty spots, a train carried behind you.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?To a ball?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?To a ball, to the opera, to the theatre.\uc1 \u8217 ? Her heart is already quivering with joy. You play with a sheet of paper between your fingers. \uc1 \u8216 ?What\uc1 \u8217 ?s that?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?It\uc1 \u8217 ?s nothing.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?It seems to me to be . . .\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?It\uc1 \u8217 ?s a note.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Who for?\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?For you, if you are at all curious.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Curious? I\uc1 \u8217 ?m really curious. Let\uc1 \u8217 ?s see it.\uc1 \u8217 ? She reads. \uc1 \u8216 ?A meeting. That\uc1 \u8217 ?s impossible.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Perhaps when you are going to mass.\uc1 \u8217 ? \uc1 \u8216 ?Mamma always comes with me. But if he came here early in the morning. I get up first, and I\uc1 \u8217 ?m at the counter before they get up.\uc1 \u8217 ? He comes. He is pleasing. One fine day at dusk the girl disappears, and I get paid my two thousand \uc1 \u233 ?cus}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs16 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs16 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 An \uc1 \u233 ?cu was a silver coin worth 6 livres (the approximate daily wage for an unskilled worker was 1.2 livres).}}}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  . . . How come you possess a talent like that and are short of bread! You wretched creature, aren\uc1 \u8217 ?t you ashamed?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \uc1 \u8217 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  I remember a group of scoundrels who couldn\uc1 \u8217 ?t hold a candle to me and who were loaded with money. I was in a buckram coat, and they were dressed in velvet, leaning on gold-headed canes shaped like ravens\uc1 \u8217 ? beaks\uc1 \u8212 ?on their fingers they had cameo rings with pictures of Aristotle or Plato. But who were they? For the most }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 part,}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  they had been incompetent musicians, and now they are bloody aristocrats! At the time it gave me courage, raised my spirits, made my mind subtle, capable of everything. But these happy states of mind apparently didn\uc1 \u8217 ?t last, because up to now I haven\uc1 \u8217 ?t been able to get ahead. Whatever the case, those are the words of my frequent soliloquies, which you can paraphrase however you like, provided you conclude from them that I understand disgust for oneself or the torment of conscience which arises from the neglect of the gifts given to us by heaven. It\uc1 \u8217 ?s the cruellest thing of all. It would almost be better for a man not to be born.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \fi-480 \cufi-200 \li480 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalph