at covering their pride, and whose sobriety is a law arising from their own needs. And music? That\uc1 \u8217 ?s when we\uc1 \u8217 ?ll make music.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs16 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sa60 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \cs16 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \super1 \chftn }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 Comte de Buffon (1707-1788): France\uc1 \u8217 ?s most famous scientist in the 18th century; Montesquieu (1689-1755): a well known and important writer of political philosophy; D\uc1 \u8217 ?Alembert (1717-1783): a mathematician and leading figure in French intellectual circles, as well as a close colleague of Diderot. Cato (the Elder) (234-148 BC): a leading Roman soldier and statesman, famous for his stern moral exhortations. }}}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025   }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af5 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \fi-480 \cufi-200 \li480 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin480 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \